.clone.*

# Wallpaper crop from a third-party theme; kept local, not redistributed.
docs/*-lab/wall.jpg

# Font subsets (Nerd Font, Omarchy's font) for the published lab only; the page
# falls back to the installed fonts locally.
docs/*-lab/fonts/

# Tooling output
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
test-results/

# Agent instructions and settings stay out of the installed plugin (Omarchy's
# plugin review rejects them; omarchy plugin add clones this tree as is). The
# development guide is DEVELOPMENT.md; a local AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md may point
# to it, and the development skills live in a local .claude/skills/.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.codex/
.agents/
